I'll let all of you take
a picture of that slide.

00:38:50.195 --> 00:38:51.820
The video will also
be up after, so you

00:38:51.820 --> 00:38:55.171
can grab it from there as well.

00:38:55.171 --> 00:38:56.170
And that's all I've got.

